
# Local secrets — do not publish
docs/INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT.md

# Clean print masters. Keep these on the fulfillment machine only.
# GitHub Pages serves the repo root, so a tracked PNG is a public download.
# See gallery/README.md.
gallery/[0-9][0-9]-*.png
gallery/print-masters/*.png
gallery/night-windows-contact-sheet.png

# Reels pipeline: licensed music must not be redistributed standalone; raw clips are un-watermarked
assets/music/*.mp3
gallery/reels/*-raw.mp4

